  "section" : {
    "accno" : "s-E-MTAB-10097",
    "type" : "Study",
    "attributes" : [ {
      "name" : "Title",
      "value" : "Single Cell Multi-Omics of Human Preimplantation Embryos Demonstrates Susceptibility to Excess Glucocorticoid Exposure(BSseq part)"
    }, {
      "name" : "Study type",
      "value" : "methylation profiling by high throughput sequencing",
      "valqual" : [ {
        "name" : "Ontology",
        "value" : "EFO"
      }, {
        "name" : "TermId",
        "value" : "EFO_0002761"
      } ]
    }, {
      "name" : "Organism",
      "value" : "Homo sapiens"
    }, {
      "name" : "Description",
      "value" : "We then utilized parallel single-cell RNA sequencing and bisulfite sequencing to explore the impact of GC exposure on the human embryo.  In addition, to further explore the role of epigenetic regulation as a mechanism for the observed transcriptional changes, we examined the effects of GCs on small non-coding RNA using smallseq."
    } ],
    "links" : [ [ {
      "url" : "E-MTAB-10096",
      "attributes" : [ {
        "name" : "Type",
        "value" : "Biostudies"
      } ]
    }, {
      "url" : "E-MTAB-10098",
      "attributes" : [ {
        "name" : "Type",
        "value" : "Biostudies"
      } ]
    } ], [ {
      "url" : "ERP127251",
      "attributes" : [ {
        "name" : "Type",
        "value" : "ENA"
      } ]
    } ] ],
    "subsections" : [ [ {
      "accno" : "P-MTAB-106718",
      "type" : "Protocols",
      "attributes" : [ {
        "name" : "Name",
        "value" : "P-MTAB-106718"
      }, {
        "name" : "Type",
        "value" : "high throughput sequence alignment protocol",
        "valqual" : [ {
          "name" : "Ontology",
          "value" : "EFO"
        }, {
          "name" : "TermId",
          "value" : "EFO_0004917"
        } ]
      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "Single-cell methylation reads were analysed by the nf-core methylseq pipeline in bismark mode with presets for single cell. Raw reads were trimmed to remove the first 6 bp (the 6N random priming portion of the reads), adaptor contamination and low quality base calls using Trim Galore (parameters: --clip_r1 6 --clip_r2 6 --three_prime_clip_r1 6 --three_prime_clip_r2 6) . Subsequently, the clean reads were mapped to the human genome (build hg38) by Bismark (parameters: –non_directional) which was followed by de-duplication and DNA methylation calling by deduplicate_bismark and bismark_methylation_extractor from Bismark tool with default settings"
      }, {
        "name" : "Hardware"
      } ]
    }, {
      "accno" : "P-MTAB-106716",
      "type" : "Protocols",
      "attributes" : [ {
        "name" : "Name",
        "value" : "P-MTAB-106716"
      }, {
        "name" : "Type",
        "value" : "growth protocol",
        "valqual" : [ {
          "name" : "Ontology",
          "value" : "EFO"
        }, {
          "name" : "TermId",
          "value" : "EFO_0003789"
        } ]
      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "Embryos were acquired fresh (not vitrified) from preimplantation genetic diagnosis (PGD) testing on embryonic day (E) 4 and were cultured until E7 (expanded blastocyst, just prior to implantation) under standard conditions as performed in the IVF Clinic (5% CO2/5% O2 in IVF plates containing 700μl of CCMTM media (Vitrolife) covered with 300μl of OvoilTM (Vitrolife)"
      }, {
        "name" : "Hardware"
      } ]
    }, {
      "accno" : "P-MTAB-106717",
      "type" : "Protocols",
      "attributes" : [ {
        "name" : "Name",
        "value" : "P-MTAB-106717"
      }, {
        "name" : "Type",
        "value" : "treatment protocol",
        "valqual" : [ {
          "name" : "Ontology",
          "value" : "EFO"
        }, {
          "name" : "TermId",
          "value" : "EFO_0003969"
        } ]
      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "Embryos were acquired fresh (not vitrified) from preimplantation genetic diagnosis (PGD) testing on embryonic day (E) 4 and were cultured until E7 (expanded blastocyst), supplemented with glucocorticoid (dexamethasone, 0.1µg/ml (2.5µM))."
      }, {
        "name" : "Hardware"
      } ]
    }, {
      "accno" : "P-MTAB-106714",
      "type" : "Protocols",
      "attributes" : [ {
        "name" : "Name",
        "value" : "P-MTAB-106714"
      }, {
        "name" : "Type",
        "value" : "nucleic acid library construction protocol",
        "valqual" : [ {
          "name" : "Ontology",
          "value" : "EFO"
        }, {
          "name" : "TermId",
          "value" : "EFO_0004184"
        } ]
      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "The cDNA libraries were generated using Smart-seq2 as previously described.The quantity and quality of the cDNA, small ncRNA and DNA methylation libraries were assessed using an Agilent 2100 BioAnalyzer (Agilent Technologies)."
      }, {
        "name" : "Hardware"
      } ]
    }, {
      "accno" : "P-MTAB-106715",
